<v Ira Glass>Of course, Ethan and the girls in that car in Illinois are sixth graders. In New York City, seventh graders Evelyn Benson and Alice Westerman are excited and feeling very grown up on their way to their school's Halloween dance.
<v Ira Glass>当然，伊桑和伊利诺伊州车里的女孩们都是六年级学生。在纽约市，七年级学生伊芙琳·本森和爱丽丝·韦斯特曼正兴奋地前往学校的万圣节舞会，感觉自己很成熟。

