<v Lisa Pollak>OK, so it's 1:20, and the dance is at 7:00.
<v Lisa Pollak>好吧，现在是下午1点20分，舞会是7点。

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.280
<v Autumn>Yeah.
<v Autumn>是的。

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.920
<v Lisa Pollak>When do you have to let him know?
<v Lisa Pollak>你什么时候必须告诉他？

