<v Autumn>大概五个左右吧。

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.760
<v Lisa Pollak>Five boys asked you to the dance?
<v Lisa Pollak>五个男生邀请你去舞会？

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.900
<v Autumn>Yeah.
<v Autumn>是的。

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:31.400
<v Lisa Pollak>You told all these guys, I don't know?
<v Lisa Pollak>你告诉所有这些人“我不知道”？

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.640
<v Autumn>Yeah.
<v Autumn>是的。

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.210
