00:57:00.520 --> 00:57:05.370
<v Elliot>They give you the dress code, and they give you the rules, "no petting." And it's in quotations.
<v Elliot>他们给你着装要求，然后给你规则：“不能有爱抚行为”。而且是加了引号的。

00:57:05.370 --> 00:57:21.020
